  "privacy": {
   "title": "Privacy Policy",
   "body": "<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; color: #444; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8;\">\n\n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 45px; padding-bottom: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; color: #9a7b4f; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n            Riverine Perfumes\n        </p>\n\n        <h1 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; color: #222; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 40px; font-weight: 500;\">\n            Privacy Policy\n        </h1>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; color: #777; font-size: 14px;\">\n            <strong>Effective Date:</strong> October 4, 2026\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n\n    <!-- Introduction -->\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #222; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500;\">\n            1. Introduction\n        </h2>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px;\">\n            Welcome to Riverine Perfumes. We value your privacy and are committed\n            to protecting your personal information when you visit our website,\n            browse our products, place an order, or communicate with us.\n        </p>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px;\">\n            This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it,\n            how we protect it, and what choices you have regarding your personal\n            information.\n        </p>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0;\">\n            By using our website, you acknowledge that you have read and understood\n            this Privacy Policy.\n        </p>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- Information We Collect -->\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #222; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500;\">\n            2. Information We Collect\n        </h2>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px;\">\n            We may collect the following types of information when you interact\n            with our website or purchase our products.\n        </p>\n\n        <h3 style=\"margin: 25px 0 10px; color: #333; font-size: 18px;\">\n            2.1 Personal Information\n        </h3>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;\">\n            When you place an order, create an account, or contact us, we may collect:\n        </p>\n\n        <ul style=\"margin: 10px 0 20px; padding-left: 25px;\">\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Full name</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Mobile phone number</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Email address</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Billing and delivery address</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Order details and purchase history</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Information you provide through customer service messages</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h3 style=\"margin: 25px 0 10px; color: #333; font-size: 18px;\">\n            2.2 Payment Information\n        </h3>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px;\">\n            We may collect payment-related information necessary to process your\n            purchases. Payments may be handled by third-party payment providers,\n            mobile financial services, banks, or cash-on-delivery services.\n        </p>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px;\">\n            We do not intend to store complete payment card details on our website.\n        </p>\n\n        <h3 style=\"margin: 25px 0 10px; color: #333; font-size: 18px;\">\n            2.3 Technical Information\n        </h3>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;\">\n            When you visit our website, certain information may be collected\n            automatically, including:\n        </p>\n\n        <ul style=\"margin: 10px 0 20px; padding-left: 25px;\">\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">IP address</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Browser type and device information</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Pages visited and time spent on the website</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Referring website or traffic source</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">Website usage and interaction data</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h3 style=\"margin: 25px 0 10px; color: #333; font-size: 18px;\">\n            2.4 Cookies and Similar Technologies\n        </h3>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0;\">\n            Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to remember your\n            preferences, maintain shopping cart functionality, improve website\n            performance, and understand visitor behaviour.\n        </p>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- How We Use Information -->\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #222; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500;\">\n            3. How We Use Your Information\n        </h2>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;\">\n            We use the information collected for the following purposes:\n        </p>\n\n        <ul style=\"margin: 10px 0 15px; padding-left: 25px;\">\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 7px;\">To process, confirm, and deliver your orders.</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 7px;\">To communicate about order status, delivery, returns, and customer support.</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 7px;\">To manage payments, refunds, and order records.</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 7px;\">To improve our website, products, services, and customer experience.</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 7px;\">To prevent fraudulent transactions, misuse, and unauthorized activities.</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 7px;\">To send promotional messages, product announcements, offers, and updates where permitted.</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 7px;\">To comply with applicable legal, tax, accounting, and regulatory obligations.</li>\n        </ul>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- Sharing -->\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #222; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500;\">\n            4. Sharing of Personal Information\n        </h2>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px;\">\n            We do not sell your personal information to third parties.\n        </p>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;\">\n            However, we may share relevant information with trusted service providers\n            when necessary to operate our business, including:\n        </p>\n\n        <ul style=\"margin: 10px 0 15px; padding-left: 25px;\">\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n                <strong>Delivery and courier companies:</strong>\n                To deliver your orders.\n            </li>\n\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n                <strong>Payment service providers:</strong>\n                To process payments and refunds.\n            </li>\n\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n                <strong>Website hosting and technology providers:</strong>\n                To maintain our website and related systems.\n            </li>\n\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n                <strong>Analytics and advertising providers:</strong>\n                To measure website performance and advertising effectiveness,\n                where applicable.\n            </li>\n\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n                <strong>Legal and regulatory authorities:</strong>\n                When disclosure is required by applicable law or a lawful request.\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- Order Processing -->\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #222; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500;\">\n            5. Order Processing and Delivery\n        </h2>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px;\">\n            To fulfil your purchase, we may share your name, phone number,\n            delivery address, and relevant order details with courier companies\n            and delivery personnel.\n        </p>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0;\">\n            This information is used to facilitate delivery, contact you regarding\n            your order, and resolve delivery-related issues.\n        </p>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- Marketing -->\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #222; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500;\">\n            6. Marketing and Promotional Communications\n        </h2>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px;\">\n            With your consent where required, we may send you information about\n            new perfume arrivals, perfume oils, attars, decants, special offers,\n            discounts, and other products or services.\n        </p>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0;\">\n            You may opt out of promotional communications at any time by following\n            the unsubscribe instructions, where available, or by contacting us directly.\n        </p>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- Security -->\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #222; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500;\">\n            7. Data Security\n        </h2>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px;\">\n            We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect\n            your personal information against unauthorized access, loss, misuse,\n            alteration, or disclosure.\n        </p>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0;\">\n            However, no method of electronic transmission or storage can be\n            guaranteed to be completely secure. We cannot guarantee absolute\n            security of information transmitted through the internet.\n        </p>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- Data Retention -->\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #222; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500;\">\n            8. Data Retention\n        </h2>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px;\">\n            We retain personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary\n            to fulfil the purposes described in this Privacy Policy, including order\n            fulfilment, customer service, accounting, legal compliance, and dispute\n            resolution.\n        </p>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0;\">\n            When information is no longer required, we will take reasonable steps\n            to delete it, anonymize it, or securely dispose of it, subject to\n            applicable legal retention requirements.\n        </p>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- Privacy Rights -->\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #222; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500;\">\n            9. Your Privacy Rights\n        </h2>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;\">\n            Subject to applicable law, you may have the right to:\n        </p>\n\n        <ul style=\"margin: 10px 0 15px; padding-left: 25px;\">\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 7px;\">Request access to personal information we hold about you.</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 7px;\">Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information.</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 7px;\">Request deletion of personal information where legally permissible.</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 7px;\">Withdraw consent for certain types of data processing.</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 7px;\">Opt out of promotional communications.</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 7px;\">Ask questions or raise concerns about how your personal information is handled.</li>\n        </ul>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- Third Party -->\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #222; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500;\">\n            10. Third-Party Websites and Services\n        </h2>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px;\">\n            Our website may contain links to third-party websites, social media\n            platforms, payment services, or other external services.\n        </p>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0;\">\n            These third parties may have their own privacy policies and data\n            handling practices. We are not responsible for the privacy practices,\n            content, or security of websites and services that we do not operate.\n        </p>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- Children's Privacy -->\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #222; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500;\">\n            11. Children's Privacy\n        </h2>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0;\">\n            Our website is intended for general consumers and is not specifically\n            designed to collect personal information from children. We do not\n            knowingly collect personal information from children in violation\n            of applicable law.\n        </p>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- International Transfers -->\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #222; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500;\">\n            12. International Data Transfers\n        </h2>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0;\">\n            Some of our website hosting, analytics, payment, or technology service\n            providers may process information outside Bangladesh. Where personal\n            information is transferred across borders, we will take reasonable\n            steps to ensure appropriate data protection safeguards are applied.\n        </p>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- Changes -->\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #222; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500;\">\n            13. Changes to This Privacy Policy\n        </h2>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0;\">\n            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes\n            in our business practices, website functionality, technology, or\n            applicable laws. Any updated version will be published on this page\n            with a revised effective date.\n        </p>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- Contact -->\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #222; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500;\">\n            14. Contact Information\n        </h2>\n\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 20px;\">\n            If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy\n            Policy or the handling of your personal information, please contact us.\n        </p>\n\n        <div style=\"padding: 25px 30px; background: #faf8f4; border-left: 4px solid #9a7b4f;\">\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 7px;\">\n                <strong>Business Name:</strong> Riverine Perfumes\n            </p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 7px;\">\n                <strong>Website:</strong>\n                <a href=\"https://yourwebsite.com\" style=\"color: #9a7b4f; text-decoration: underline;\">\n                    yourwebsite.com\n                </a>\n            </p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 7px;\">\n                <strong>Email:</strong>\n                <a href=\"mailto:your@email.com\" style=\"color: #9a7b4f; text-decoration: underline;\">\n                    your@email.com\n                </a>\n            </p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 7px;\">\n                <strong>Phone / WhatsApp:</strong> +880 XXX XXXXXXX\n            </p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0;\">\n                <strong>Business Address:</strong> Your Business Address, Bangladesh\n            </p>\n\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n</div>",
